  "description": "Fatigued by a life of crushing expectations, corporate worker Yun-seo finds solace in an otome game. Then, a single update kickstarts a transmigration where she awakens as Lody Evant, the empire's infamous villainess. Abandoned by her ducal family, banished to a run-down shack, and hated by the locals, her prospects for survival appear grim. Her fortunes turn when she discovers a powerful in-game cheat: the ability to see everyone's darkest, most guarded secrets. Utilizing her business acumen, fearless confidence, and profitable extortion tactics, Lody takes charge to overturn her grim destiny and amass a vast fortune. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
